  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production Help Guide\n\n### How to Import a Trial Balance from Xero \n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 16 Jul, 2021 at  3:34 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: Accounts Production > Tasks > Trial Balance > Mode of Import: Xero \n\nRefer to the link\n\nPlease click here to find out about Xero automapping\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\nOnce in Accounts production, navigate to a client workspace. Once there, head to Tasks > Trial Balance and click the + icon to create a new Trial Balance.\n\nNext, enter a description, choose between Annual/Management, choose the Accounting Period and tick Xero for the mode of import. Once you click 'create' you will be redirected to Xero, where you will need to enter your credentials and select a company to import from. \n\nThe final step is to map the entries to Capium's Chart of Accounts. If a particular code isn't available in Capium, use the '+Add Account' option to create a new account.\n\nClick here to watch how to Import a Trial Balance from Xero\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188540\">Accounts Production Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to Import a Trial Balance from Xero \n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 16 Jul, 2021 at  3:34 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Location:</strong> Accounts Production &gt; Tasks &gt; Trial Balance &gt; Mode of Import: Xero&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/accounts/tasks/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a></p><p><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/accounts/tasks/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://support.capium.com/support/solutions/articles/9000204524-trial-balance-automated-mapping-from-xero-and-quickbooks\">Please click here to find out about Xero automapping</a></p><p><br></p><p>Help/Guide:</p><p>Once in Accounts production, navigate to a client workspace. Once there, head to Tasks &gt; Trial Balance and click the + icon to create a new Trial Balance.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805444/original/DkvIXhKBVGq_juvjk8C7UoHWMgFL8TJ7Pw.png?1567072122\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805444/original/DkvIXhKBVGq_juvjk8C7UoHWMgFL8TJ7Pw.png?1567072122\" data-fileid=\"9084805444\" data-uniquekey=\"1567071800816\" style=\"width: 840px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>Next, enter a description, choose between Annual/Management, choose the Accounting Period and tick Xero for the mode of import. Once you click 'create' you will be redirected to Xero, where you will need to enter your credentials and select a company to import from.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805611/original/1kONgDliWg74DOfThqXFlIgjz4gHFZ1Jug.png?1567072249\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805611/original/1kONgDliWg74DOfThqXFlIgjz4gHFZ1Jug.png?1567072249\" data-fileid=\"9084805611\" data-uniquekey=\"1567071800816\" style=\"width: 840px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>The final step is to map the entries to Capium's Chart of Accounts. If a particular code isn't available in Capium, use the '+Add Account' option to create a new account.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805997/original/ngLXpW7G30gtKSFxhbV6PARZmFI6gJxoLA.png?1567072618\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805997/original/ngLXpW7G30gtKSFxhbV6PARZmFI6gJxoLA.png?1567072618\" data-fileid=\"9084805997\" data-uniquekey=\"1567071800816\" style=\"width: 839px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/1f0baf70fb45406ea86dc30d968629be\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to Import a Trial Balance from Xero</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000174314\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span da